        <body>
            <div xml:id="d13">

                <pb facs="0067" n="29" xml:id="pg29"/>

                <head>13. Memorandum From the Executive Secretary of the Department of State
                        (Read) to the President’s
                    Special Assistant for National Security Affairs (Bundy)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d13-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1964-01-13">January 13, 1964</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Memorandum for the Attorney General’s Meeting with Sukarno of Indonesia</item>
                </list>
                <p>There is enclosed a memorandum for the Attorney General’s meeting with President
                        Sukarno. This memorandum will be
                    discussed at a meeting in the White House on January 14.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d13-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">
                            Benjamin H. Read
                        </hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d13-f3"/>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d13-a1.xml" xpointer="d13-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d13-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d13-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files
                    1964–66, ORG 7 JUS. Secret. Drafted by Cuthell, cleared with Bell, Hilsman, and in
                    draft with Harriman.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d13-f2" n="2" xml:id="d13-f2-content">
                <p>The President met with Robert Kennedy,
                        Rusk, McNamara, Harriman,
                        McCone, and
                        Bundy on January 14 from 10:30 to 10:50 a.m. (Johnson
                    Library, President’s Daily Diary) See <ref target="#d15">Document 15</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d13-f3" n="3" xml:id="d13-f3-content">
                <p>Printed from a copy that indicates John A. McKesson signed for Read.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
